ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models

Project Name

ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models

Purpose

The purpose of ComicCraft is to help users create creative comic story content using Generative AI.

Benefits

ComicCraft can reduce the time required for initial story creation and assist beginners and creative users in developing story ideas.

Working Process

1. Open the ComicCraft application.
2. Enter a story idea or prompt.
3. Submit the prompt.
4. The backend processes the input.
5. The Gemini model generates the story.
6. The generated story is displayed on the application.

Final Output

The final output is an AI-generated comic story based on the user's input.

Conclusion

ComicCraft demonstrates how Gemini models can be integrated into an application to support creative storytelling and AI-assisted comic story generation.
